00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 5.6 · Internal Systems & Operations
Finance, procurement and internal controls overview

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Keep organisational money separate and checked by someone other than the spender.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Two people approve payments above a set amount.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Keep a receipt for every transaction.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Reconcile monthly, with a second person signing.

6
