An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“The clerk prepares weaver payments; Meera checks them; Meera and the treasurer co-sign. Audited yearly by the cooperative department.”

8
